<div class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow mono">SMART MONEY ENTRY MODELS</div>
  <h1>NIC <span class="accent">ሞዴሎች</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">ከላይቭ ባክቴስት ሴሽኑ የተጠናቀረ ሙሉ ማጠቃለያ — Fake Out፣ Order Flow Shift እና Flip ሶስቱም ሞዴሎች በተመሳሳይ የማርኬት structure ላይ እንዴት እንደሚለያዩ፣ መቼ ጥቅም ላይ እንደሚውሉ፣ እና ትክክለኛ Entry/SL አቀማመጥ ደረጃ በደረጃ።</p>
  <div class="ticker">
    <div class="ticker-track mono">
      <span class="ticker-item">XAUUSD <b>DEMAND ZONE</b></span>
      <span class="ticker-item up">FAKE OUT ▲ ዊክ ብቻ</span>
      <span class="ticker-item">ORDER FLOW SHIFT <b>2 KILVL</b></span>
      <span class="ticker-item down">FLIP ▼ ፑልባክ የለም</span>
      <span class="ticker-item">ENTRY ZONE <b>WICK → BODY</b></span>
      <span class="ticker-item up">MANIPULATION REQUIRED</span>
      <span class="ticker-item">SL <b>30 PIP · GOLD</b></span>
      <span class="ticker-item down">VALID LOSS ≠ MISTAKE</span>
      <!-- duplicate for seamless loop -->
      <span class="ticker-item">XAUUSD <b>DEMAND ZONE</b></span>
      <span class="ticker-item up">FAKE OUT ▲ ዊክ ብቻ</span>
